The preparation of shaky beef involves choosing the most tender cut of beef. Then you cut the steak into 1 inch cubes and marinate with oyster sauce, soy sauce, minced garlic, salt, and pepper. Then you add oil to a heating pan and wait until it's ripping. After that, you sear your beef for about 2 minutes, add sliced onions and continue to stir until the onions are barely tender. The last step is to serve the beef over a bed of greens and vegetables of your choice.

